@startuml workflow-stages
title Millwright-Inspector Workflow — Stages

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ArrowFontColor #555555
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #8B7500
  FontColor #222222
  RoundCorner 12
}

' Color the auto-fired stages distinctly from inspector-driven ones
skinparam rectangle<<auto>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEF7FF
  BorderColor #2C7BB6
}
skinparam rectangle<<inspector>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #8B7500
}
skinparam rectangle<<isolated>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF0F5
  BorderColor #B0457E
}
skinparam rectangle<<terminal>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
}

rectangle "**Stage 0 — Journal populated**\n//Inspector drops .md/.txt files into\njournal/<folder>/. No mi command yet.//" as S0 <<inspector>>

rectangle "**Stage 1 — Quest scaffolded**\n//`/mi-run <folders>` creates quest/<slug>/\nwith todo-list.md, summary.md, progress.md\n(features grouped, queue empty).//" as S1 <<inspector>>

rectangle "**Stage 1.5 — Selection + queue confirm**\n//Inspector marks `[x] (name)` items;\n`/mi-continue` ×2 promotes to PENDING,\nproposes order, writes queue-rationale.md.//" as S15 <<inspector>>

rectangle "**Stage 2 — Blueprints generated**\n//`/mi-apply-impact` (auto) activates queue[0],\nwrites blueprints/current/ requirements.md,\nconfig.md, diagrams/. Inspector replies `approve`.//" as S2 <<auto>>

rectangle "**Stage 3 — Chain launched**\n//`/mi-plan-implementation` (auto) validates\n## GIT BRANCH, captures base-commit, writes\nprimer.md, hands off to brainstorming chain.//" as S3 <<isolated>>

rectangle "**Stage 4 — Chain resumed**\n//`/mi-continue` (1st): drift check, optional\n`/mi-update-blueprint`, render implementation/\ndiagrams/, seed inspector-review.md skeleton.//" as S4 <<auto>>

rectangle "**Stage 5 — Inspector review**\n//Inspector reads base..HEAD + diagrams/,\nedits inspector-review.md (### IR-NNN blocks\nor leaves empty), then `/mi-continue` (2nd).//" as S5 <<inspector>>

rectangle "**Stage 6 — Review session**\n//If findings: `/mi-review` (auto) launches an\nisolated brainstorming chain that fixes /\nre-implements / re-plans until `approve`.//" as S6 <<isolated>>

rectangle "**Stage 7 — Post-review resume**\n//`/mi-continue` (3rd): sanity-check no open\nfindings remain; mark inspector-review-completed;\nadvance 6 → 7. Skipped if Stage 5 was empty.//" as S7 <<auto>>

rectangle "**Stage 8 — Completion**\n//`/mi-complete-workflow` (auto): IMPLEMENTING →\nIMPLEMENTED, rotate blueprints/current/ → history/,\narchive implementation/, advance feature queue.//" as S8 <<terminal>>

' --- Main flow ---
S0  -down-> S1   : inspector types\n/mi-run
S1  -down-> S15  : inspector marks\n[x] (name)
S15 -down-> S2   : queue confirmed
S2  -down-> S3   : `approve`
S3  -down-> S4   : chain exits +\n/mi-continue (1st)
S4  -down-> S5   : review scaffold\nready
S5  -down-> S6   : findings present\n+ /mi-continue (2nd)
S5  -right-> S7  : no findings\n(skip Stage 6)
S6  -down-> S7   : `approve` +\n/mi-continue (3rd)
S7  -down-> S8   : auto-finalize

' --- Loop back: more features in queue ---
S8 -left-> S2 : queue non-empty\n(next feature)

' Legend
legend right
| Color | Meaning |
| <back:#FFF8DC>     </back> | Inspector-driven stage |
| <back:#EEF7FF>     </back> | Millwright auto-fired |
| <back:#FFF0F5>     </back> | Isolated chain (Stage 3 / 6) |
| <back:#E8F5E9>     </back> | Terminal / loop-back |
endlegend

@enduml
